# Shared studio Supabase project. Every Reboot prototype uses this one project;
# the `prototype` column in src/config.ts namespaces each game's levels.
#
# Committed on purpose. This key is embedded in the JS bundle and extractable
# from any build, so it is treated as public rather than pretended to be secret.
# It grants read/insert/update on the levels table and nothing else -- no delete,
# no other table. To retire it, roll the key in the Supabase dashboard; deleting
# this file will not remove it from git history. The service_role / secret key
# never belongs here.
#
# Nothing to set up in a new prototype: the table already exists. Just change
# PROTOTYPE in src/config.ts.
